Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 10:29:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace article layer tabs with sequential scrolling sections

Removed the sticky Layer 1/2/3 tab bar (Overview/Analysis/Technical
switcher) from article pages. All three layers now render together,
in order, on the same page as distinct sections with a small heading
divider between them, so readers scroll from plain-English overview
through deep analysis into full technical detail instead of clicking
between tabs.

Also drops the now-unused ?layer= query param and searchParams plumbing,
since there's nothing left to switch between.

